    "Category Funding runs only for manual expenses entered from the selected account and funds only the required shortfall. Set up a Shortcuts automation that logs tap-to-pay purchases from Apple Wallet, or import Apple Card, Apple Cash and Savings transactions directly.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Category Funding runs only for manual expenses entered from the selected account and funds only the required shortfall. Set up a Shortcuts automation that logs tap-to-pay purchases from Apple Wallet, or import Apple Card, Apple Cash and Savings transactions directly."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le financement des catégories ne s'applique qu'aux dépenses manuelles saisies depuis le compte sélectionné et ne finance que le déficit nécessaire. Configurez une automatisation Raccourcis qui enregistre les achats sans contact depuis Apple Wallet, ou importez directement les transactions Apple Card, Apple Cash et Savings."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La financiación de categorías solo se aplica a los gastos manuales introducidos desde la cuenta seleccionada y financia únicamente el déficit necesario. Configure una automatización de Atajos que registre las compras sin contacto de Apple Wallet, o importe directamente las transacciones de Apple Card, Apple Cash y Savings."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O financiamento de categorias funciona apenas para despesas manuais inseridas na conta selecionada e financia apenas o déficit necessário. Configure uma automação do Atalhos que registre compras por aproximação do Apple Wallet, ou importe diretamente as transações do Apple Card, Apple Cash e Savings."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kategoriefinanzierung läuft nur für manuell erfasste Ausgaben vom ausgewählten Konto und finanziert nur den erforderlichen Fehlbetrag. Richten Sie eine Shortcuts-Automatisierung ein, die Tap-to-Pay-Käufe aus Apple Wallet protokolliert, oder importieren Sie Apple Card-, Apple Cash- und Savings-Transaktionen direkt."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il finanziamento delle categorie viene applicato solo alle spese manuali inserite dal conto selezionato e copre solo il disavanzo necessario. Configura un'automazione di Comandi Rapidi che registri gli acquisti contactless da Apple Wallet, oppure importa direttamente le transazioni di Apple Card, Apple Cash e Savings."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Categoriefinanciering geldt alleen voor handmatige uitgaven die vanaf de geselecteerde rekening zijn ingevoerd en financiert alleen het benodigde tekort. Stel een Shortcuts-automatisering in die tap-to-pay-aankopen vanuit Apple Wallet registreert, of importeer Apple Card-, Apple Cash- en Savings-transacties rechtstreeks."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Category Funding runs only for manual expenses entered from the selected account and funds only the required shortfall. Set up a Shortcuts automation that logs tap-to-pay purchases from Apple Wallet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Category Funding runs only for manual expenses entered from the selected account and funds only the required shortfall. Set up a Shortcuts automation that logs tap-to-pay purchases from Apple Wallet."
